"Alert when a bus that was reporting goes silent for this long. 0 disables "
"the alert."
msgstr ""
"Alerta cuando un bus que venía reportando queda en silencio este tiempo. Con"
" 0 se desactiva."

#. module: bus_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bus_tracking.field_res_config_settings__bus_late_start_minutes
msgid ""
"Alert when a planned trip has not started this long after its planned "
"departure. 0 disables the alert."
msgstr ""
"Alerta cuando un recorrido planificado no ha salido pasado este tiempo desde"
" su hora de salida. 0 desactiva la alerta."

